reaking my pairs (KK, 1010) or my powerful triplet of 2s. If I were to play a King or 10, I would have to break a pair, leaving me with loose singles that are harder to play later.\n3. **Control**: With three 2s and a Black Joker remaining, I can confidently play the Ace knowing I can likely regain control if the Landlord beats it with a 2.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": ["♣A"]}'}
